            | Do you require secure app or website development?
            br
            br
            | Hi, I'm Andrew, and I am a Full Stack JavaScript Developer. Whether you require front-end, back-end or both, developing JavaScript apps is what I do.
            br
            br
            | Concerned about security? So am I - with so many online threats out there, keeping our apps safe is an ongoing battle. With this in mind, I completed IBM's course in Application Security for Developers, to make sure all apps I work on are secure. 
            br
            br
            | I started my development journey by creating WordPress websites starting from 2020. This experience now includes the development and management of eCommerce, subscriptions, email marketing, advertising, GDPR, and SEO.
            br
            br
            | I later completed Harvard University's famous CS50 course. In doing so, I discovered that JavaScript was for me, and began a years-long journey in studying this complex and beautiful language.
            br
            br
